      "id": 145327,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-07-23T15:29:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I shall add a bit more detail to this Kraken. There were 5 environment card palys before it, two Mystical Defenses, Hallway Collapse, Phosphorescent Chamber, and Atlantean Font of Power. Dark Watch NightMist, America's Greatest Legacy, and Absolute Zero were all knocked out. Mister Fixer plus all the incapped powers was able to get Apostate down to 1 HP, matching his own. The only hope for Mister Fixer to make it out of it alive was for one of the three Kraken appendages or the last copy of Hallway Collapse. For those keeping track, that's a 40% chance of Mister Fixer pulling the victory. Yay, The Kraken!</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:23:04.608Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
